# Ownership of every path in this repository.
#
# GitHub never requests review from a pull request's own author, so this
# assigns nothing on Bertan's own PRs. It exists to route contributions from
# forks of this public repository, and to state ownership explicitly.
#
# Do not pair this with branch protection's "Require review from Code Owners":
# a sole owner who authors every PR cannot approve their own, and the rule
# would make every PR into main unmergeable without an admin override.

